{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11959","headline":"舟中夜雪有怀卢十四侍御弟 · 杜甫","name":"舟中夜雪有怀卢十四侍御弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朔风吹桂水，朔雪夜纷纷。\n暗度南楼月，寒深北渚云。\n烛斜初近见，舟重竟无闻。\n不识山阴道，听鸡更忆君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11959.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11959","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}